%% Component Diagram: Youth Account Management Solution (C4 Style)
flowchart TD
  subgraph Web_Application[Banking Web Application]
    UI[Parent UI (React)]
    API[Youth Account API (Node.js)]
    DB[(PostgreSQL DB)]
  end

  GW[API Gateway]
  ACC[Account Service]
  PAY[Payment Service]
  LEDGER[Transaction Ledger Service]

  Parent[Parent/Guardian]
  Youth[Youth]

  Parent-->|Uses|UI
  Youth-->|Uses|UI
  UI-->|API Calls (OAuth, RBAC)|GW
  GW-->|Routes|API
  API-->|Read/Write|DB
  API-->|Account Details|ACC
  API-->|Fund Transfer|PAY
  API-->|Transaction History|LEDGER

  %% Compliance and Auditability
  classDef compliance fill:#F3F6FB,stroke:#2B7A78,stroke-width:2px;
  API:::compliance
  GW:::compliance
  DB:::compliance

  %% Notes
  note right of API: OAuth2, RBAC, Audit Logging, GDPR, PCI-DSS, ISO 27001
  note right of GW: Auth, Routing, RBAC
  note right of DB: Encrypted, Audit trail
